[node name="MessageBlock" parent="." instance=ExtResource("22_63t78")]
position = Vector2(-16, 16)
message = "WELCOME TO MARIO FOREVER EXPERT MODE!

THIS MODE TAKES 8 STORY MODE WORLDS AND MAKES THEM MUCH MORE DIFFICULT, ADDING NEW ENEMIES AND OBSTACLES THROUGHOUT THE LEVELS.

EXPERT MODE QUIRKS:
- SOME TWEAKS ARE ENFORCED IN THIS MODE: MINI-GAMES ARE ALWAYS ON; STOMPING COMBOS ARE ALWAYS OFF.
- ONLY 3 GAME OVER CONTINUES FOR THE GAME SESSION!
- MARIO'S PHYSICS ARE ENFORCED.
- MOST EXTRAS USUALLY FOUND IN NORMAL LEVELS ARE NOT ACCESSIBLE IN THIS MODE.
- ACCESS ITEM SHOP MID-LEVEL BY PRESSING UP + TAB.

GOOD LUCK!"
box_size = Vector2(448, 240)
message_label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_484da")

